{
  "version": 0,
  "note": "Runs on normalised, masked, case-folded text. Terms match whole words; a trailing * allows any word ending. Patterns stay in the Java/JavaScript common regex subset. Negation is searched with the signal's own matches blanked to spaces, so ' {5,}' in a negation pattern stands for the signal's own word (as in 'nobody can guarantee').",
